        "name": "Percentage"
      },
      "category": "Quantitative Aptitude",
      "question": "[Sample] A student has to secure 40% marks to pass an examination. He gets 178 marks and fails by 22 marks. What are the maximum marks of the examination?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] एक परीक्षा उत्तीर्ण करने के लिए छात्र को 40% अंक प्राप्त करने होते हैं। वह 178 अंक प्राप्त करता है और 22 अंकों से अनुत्तीर्ण हो जाता है। अधिकतम अंक क्या हैं?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "450"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "500"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "550"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "600"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "explanation": "Passing marks = 178 + 22 = 200. Since 40% = 200, Maximum marks (100%) = 500.",
      "exam": {
        "name": "SSC GD",
        "year": 2024,
        "shift": "Shift 2"
      },
      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "source": {
        "pdf": "Sample_percentage.pdf",
        "page": 1,
