      "category": "Quantitative Aptitude",
      "question": "[Sample] The population of a town increases by 10% annually. If its present population is 60,500, what was its population 2 years ago?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] एक कस्बे की जनसंख्या सालाना 10% बढ़ जाती है। यदि इसकी वर्तमान जनसंख्या 60,500 है, तो 2 वर्ष पहले इसकी जनसंख्या क्या थी?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "48,000"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "50,000"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "52,000"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "55,000"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "explanation": "P × (1.1)² = 60500 => P × 1.21 = 60500 => P = 50,000.",
