      "category": "Quantitative Aptitude",
      "question": "[Sample] Fresh fruit contains 68% water and dry fruit contains 20% water. How much dry fruit can be obtained from 100 kg of fresh fruits?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] ताजे फल में 68% पानी होता है और सूखे फल में 20% पानी होता है। 100 किग्रा ताजे फलों से कितना सूखा फल प्राप्त किया जा सकता है?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "32 kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "40 kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "42 kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "48 kg"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "explanation": "Solid pulp remains constant: 32% of 100 kg = 80% of Dry fruit => Dry fruit = 32 / 0.8 = 40 kg.",
